// 1. Insurance information
// 2. Years in business (15+ years)
// 3. Certifications (all held: Gaz G1/G2, PEB Cerga, VCA, Buildwise)
// 4. Service guarantees (2 years parts/labor, 10 years decennial, fixed quotes)
// 5. Response time promises (20-30 min, 24/7 emergency dispatch)
